            {
                "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                "word": "leh",
                "pos": "particle",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "444fb9a0-e4c7-3130-acf3-90b5b121d63f",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Used to convey uncertainty (in response to inconsistent information)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2ee22f0-1809-4063-be79-701886bcf1eb",
                                "sense_id": "444fb9a0-e4c7-3130-acf3-90b5b121d63f",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: mid [lɛ˧], (interrogative) high-mid [lɛ˦]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a0665ee-77db-45ac-8f0e-65f05ebca504",
                                "sense_id": "444fb9a0-e4c7-3130-acf3-90b5b121d63f",
                                "text": "No leh, it’s right here.",
                                "translation": "No? It’s right here.",
                                "english": "No? It’s right here."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11085cb5-93fa-4ba5-8121-093601e69d5d",
                                "sense_id": "444fb9a0-e4c7-3130-acf3-90b5b121d63f",
                                "text": "I counted 30 leh.",
                                "translation": "But I counted 30.",
                                "english": "But I counted 30."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1fdb3670-2fb5-402c-932b-647223c827bc",
                                "sense_id": "444fb9a0-e4c7-3130-acf3-90b5b121d63f",
                                "text": "Why-ah? What happened to the lift-ah. Going up. Going down. But never stop. Door never open some more. Don't know-leh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b0f6e9f-f835-4473-ab74-aca7f54be486",
                                "sense_id": "444fb9a0-e4c7-3130-acf3-90b5b121d63f",
                                "text": "You got send [e-mail] meh? I never receive leh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36b1033f-20b1-40d5-863e-80d959cf3a5f",
                                "sense_id": "444fb9a0-e4c7-3130-acf3-90b5b121d63f",
                                "text": "How come got 81 judges and then the number of votes is 45 vs 47 leh? 45+47 is 92 leh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7ea8cf6-9c1e-4b18-9933-2b47f9e8df87",
                                "sense_id": "444fb9a0-e4c7-3130-acf3-90b5b121d63f",
                                "text": "If you’re asked something that would incriminate a fellow colleague, you just say, ‘I don’t know leh,’ and you’re in the clear (conscience-wise). Though seriously, you’re still indirectly complicit."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a537c331-c26b-3e24-801b-52d0947cda4e",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Used to form “what about … ?” questions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish",
                            "interrogative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2a29b29-491f-4f96-800f-ab7ad28c51f3",
                                "sense_id": "a537c331-c26b-3e24-801b-52d0947cda4e",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: (interrogative) high-mid [lɛ˦]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "459b49b7-c319-4bee-a141-fe4c8e7db819",
                                "sense_id": "a537c331-c26b-3e24-801b-52d0947cda4e",
                                "text": "Our appointment leh?",
                                "translation": "What about our appointment?",
                                "english": "What about our appointment?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67ac8f11-3fd6-4331-ac05-59b93f3baa10",
                                "sense_id": "a537c331-c26b-3e24-801b-52d0947cda4e",
                                "text": "OK, this one, leh?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6c862d52-69fc-3157-9def-ed9bbc1656b2",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Used to highlight or relay noteworthy information."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "290b1118-265e-4551-a558-9567d4018fe4",
                                "sense_id": "6c862d52-69fc-3157-9def-ed9bbc1656b2",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: low-mid [lɛ˨]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30239551-6853-4e15-a8d1-2cd7a28f11f1",
                                "sense_id": "6c862d52-69fc-3157-9def-ed9bbc1656b2",
                                "text": "It’s next week leh.",
                                "translation": "Just so you know, it’s next week.",
                                "english": "Just so you know, it’s next week."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a6b461e-59db-4aaa-a38e-846a34ef804f",
                                "sense_id": "6c862d52-69fc-3157-9def-ed9bbc1656b2",
                                "text": "“After I got the degree, I told my dad that I’m going to do an MBA. He said, ‘Eh, no more money leh’. But I said, ‘It’s okay’.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "725e060b-0136-3f8e-9901-5aa4b3d4d406",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Used to highlight the severity or seriousness of a situation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e23699a7-37a4-4c36-93e5-52bec242b0e6",
                                "sense_id": "725e060b-0136-3f8e-9901-5aa4b3d4d406",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: low-mid [lɛ˨]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c8ec21a-408f-4ace-95f2-04875c831177",
                                "sense_id": "725e060b-0136-3f8e-9901-5aa4b3d4d406",
                                "text": "Many houses were destroyed leh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb03cd9d-85bf-4cf4-80bf-1fb924c02395",
                                "sense_id": "725e060b-0136-3f8e-9901-5aa4b3d4d406",
                                "text": "Thirty-five thousand jobs, leh. Not something to sneeze at."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3803700b-a7d9-47be-a14a-d5caa0a252a4",
                                "sense_id": "725e060b-0136-3f8e-9901-5aa4b3d4d406",
                                "text": "Navigating gradients in high heels, she says with a giggle, is “no joke leh”. She is, however, more than adroit and willing to tackle more difficult courses, like blazing new trails for Singapore’s nascent space industry."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "24bb8e5f-3e77-3075-be24-8dfcff3086cc",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Reinforces the truth of a declarative remark."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfb603a0-6890-42e9-bf14-cb96faa335fb",
                                "sense_id": "24bb8e5f-3e77-3075-be24-8dfcff3086cc",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: low-mid [lɛ˨]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad8ab455-665e-4eb6-a3fc-17e38a549de0",
                                "sense_id": "24bb8e5f-3e77-3075-be24-8dfcff3086cc",
                                "text": "You all damn noisy leh how to sleep?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "548b1fda-9977-4237-87ed-b57f3e60e5dc",
                                "sense_id": "24bb8e5f-3e77-3075-be24-8dfcff3086cc",
                                "text": "We put all the poetry packets in a bag and let people rummage through it and pick one at random when they left the house. […] “Amazing leh, I can’t believe it was a random pick,” he texted me later, “This is better than ang pow!”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e39de9e-247c-42bb-acbe-572490281bf3",
                                "sense_id": "24bb8e5f-3e77-3075-be24-8dfcff3086cc",
                                "text": "“They asked me to do the striptease. I said no,” confessed Bachelor #1. / “Why not? You’re from NDU leh,” I remarked, surprised that even someone from the Naval Diving Unit would be shy about showing his body."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "50f1cf9e-0011-3fb4-b1f3-714903f27c0c",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Indicates a tentative reminder."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cd9fdaf-50f9-429b-90bc-49ff1ee452d0",
                                "sense_id": "50f1cf9e-0011-3fb4-b1f3-714903f27c0c",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: low-mid [lɛ˨]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00425164-290e-452a-9e81-ea1a5611a806",
                                "sense_id": "50f1cf9e-0011-3fb4-b1f3-714903f27c0c",
                                "text": "Still got risotto in the fridge leh.",
                                "translation": "There’s still some risotto in the fridge.",
                                "english": "There’s still some risotto in the fridge."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3384fac2-8d05-4e73-bb0c-b39ef79ac087",
                                "sense_id": "50f1cf9e-0011-3fb4-b1f3-714903f27c0c",
                                "text": "“Today Friday leh, I want to go out!” they imagined Dr Tan thinking."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f00266f9-cf20-4ed8-b8d3-405ebcb29020",
                                "sense_id": "50f1cf9e-0011-3fb4-b1f3-714903f27c0c",
                                "text": "I just wanna have a lil dance to some tunes. Tomorrow still got work leh"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8ae989da-d130-3315-97c9-cd6e0c0c25d6",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Indicates a tentative request."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish",
                            "imperative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ea48f24-5f18-443d-aee8-00b871d09a8f",
                                "sense_id": "8ae989da-d130-3315-97c9-cd6e0c0c25d6",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: mid [lɛ˧]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3610ee9b-db86-4724-a473-10f5d10e3305",
                                "sense_id": "8ae989da-d130-3315-97c9-cd6e0c0c25d6",
                                "text": "Close the door leh.",
                                "translation": "Why don’t you close the door?",
                                "english": "Why don’t you close the door?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37dbf9e1-1870-4f8f-8030-665b0109648b",
                                "sense_id": "8ae989da-d130-3315-97c9-cd6e0c0c25d6",
                                "text": "Hello Mr Chan — why alone? Where's the better half? Bring her next time eh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f993f549-9fcf-45d4-9ed0-f0ca414f4daa",
                                "sense_id": "8ae989da-d130-3315-97c9-cd6e0c0c25d6",
                                "text": "Sing us a song, leh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90b8350e-481d-4fde-bc0c-d2b650f2accb",
                                "sense_id": "8ae989da-d130-3315-97c9-cd6e0c0c25d6",
                                "text": "It feels like a cheap gimmick to attract environmentalist types, when I don’t see any concrete policies to address that. If you don’t care, then don’t pretend to care leh. If you care, then make sure you got details to back you up, can?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "90e22b4d-5363-3ca6-8d66-c46f058accea",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Indicates disagreement with an idea or suggestion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a83fb027-1cae-42c3-87d3-1c43b67ad2e2",
                                "sense_id": "90e22b4d-5363-3ca6-8d66-c46f058accea",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: mid [lɛ˧]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b1bbf8a-db5b-42de-91f3-cbf32ac35038",
                                "sense_id": "90e22b4d-5363-3ca6-8d66-c46f058accea",
                                "text": "— We can try taking the train.\n— I don’t think we’ll have enough time leh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6bfebd2d-1c62-415a-9135-04680bc9fa7b",
                                "sense_id": "90e22b4d-5363-3ca6-8d66-c46f058accea",
                                "text": "Singaporean poet Cyril Wong might have been one of the first home-grown writers to depict sexuality so frankly on the page, but on the occasion of his 16th poetry collection, he laments: “I’m not just a confessional writer leh.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4184f3ae-8ef3-3053-945f-8e6a0d78dd47",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Used to soften a disagreeing opinion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "97a2c146-6991-4453-bc69-745ec85673e6",
                                "sense_id": "4184f3ae-8ef3-3053-945f-8e6a0d78dd47",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: mid [lɛ˧]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56969505-ea1b-4b9e-bff7-19340f2732e0",
                                "sense_id": "4184f3ae-8ef3-3053-945f-8e6a0d78dd47",
                                "text": "I don’t think that’s accurate leh."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ec952b5-dcdc-32e7-b196-d3e97eae3b48",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Reinforces a tentative opinion and invites agreement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "386454ec-e172-4a06-a62f-8bb967a76d51",
                                "sense_id": "9ec952b5-dcdc-32e7-b196-d3e97eae3b48",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: mid [lɛ˧]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5a9f096-7caa-49f1-b5d0-f71935e683f2",
                                "sense_id": "9ec952b5-dcdc-32e7-b196-d3e97eae3b48",
                                "text": "In my opinion the crème brûlée was so-so only leh."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bfcbe439-4850-380c-b61e-0eecd80ab8e2",
                        "entry_id": "6691e817-62ba-36d8-802f-e0a480b75c7c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Used to suggest that the listener has failed to take something into consideration."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e594eda3-326a-426e-8741-9bd6e5b9f86c",
                                "sense_id": "bfcbe439-4850-380c-b61e-0eecd80ab8e2",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: mid [lɛ˧]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5aa6ce0-3cba-4230-ab41-42af8df66c49",
                                "sense_id": "bfcbe439-4850-380c-b61e-0eecd80ab8e2",
                                "text": "I don’t have all day leh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07801861-4391-4714-b1ca-06f106f6a7a4",
                                "sense_id": "bfcbe439-4850-380c-b61e-0eecd80ab8e2",
                                "text": "Lester did not want to tell me about his feelings for his friend or his reasons for not talking about this absence of labels because “It’s a very private topic leh”—a telling response in itself."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
